    "details": "<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1v13wzu\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"27\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"27\">BUILD WHAT COMES NEXT</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"85\"><strong data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"85\">24 Hours. 100 Teams. 25 Winners. ₹2.5 Lakh+ Rewards.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"194\">Join a <strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"124\">24-hour offline Buildathon</strong> bringing together Blockchain, AI, Robotics and emerging technologies.</p>\n<p data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"321\"><strong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"214\">MST Blockchain</strong> is an Indian Layer 1 blockchain, while <strong data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"264\">NEWRRO</strong> brings expertise in robotics, AI and autonomous systems.</p>\n<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"399\"><strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"332\">Date:</strong> 28&ndash;29 September<br data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"351\" /><strong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"361\">Venue:</strong> BMS College of Engineering, Bengaluru</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"etlo8p\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"435\">Registration &amp; Team Capacity</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"869\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsevw8\" data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"487\"><strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"487\">Maximum 100 Teams | First Come, First Served</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1viib7k\" data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"567\"><strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"567\">Registration remains open as long as the registration option is available</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1n55h2f\" data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"685\">The 100-team limit applies to confirmed team registrations, not the total participant count displayed on Unstop</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"p92ux0\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"754\"><strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"754\">If the registration option is open, you can register your team</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"o6nvc3\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"818\"><strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"818\">Once 100 teams are confirmed, registration will be closed</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mo9jkp\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"869\"><strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"869\">25 Guaranteed Winning Teams out of 100 Teams</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"982\">Join a <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"908\">24-hour offline Buildathon</strong> bringing together <strong data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"982\">Blockchain, AI, Robotics and emerging technologies.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1124\">Build real-world solutions across <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1124\">Web3, DeFi, RWA, Consumer Payments, AI Agents, Robotics, DePIN, Identity, Gaming, Enterprise and more.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1251\"><strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1144\">MST Blockchain</strong> is an Indian Layer 1 blockchain, while <strong data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1194\">NEWRRO</strong> brings expertise in robotics, AI and autonomous systems.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kk8cq0\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1272\">Why Participate?</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1628\">\n<li data-section-id=\"nhta5k\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1317\"><strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1296\">25 Winning Teams</strong> from up to 100 teams</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12pbo7a\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1351\"><strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1351\">₹2.5 Lakh+ Worth of Rewards</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ev9l7i\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1416\"><strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1379\">Grants up to ₹50 Lakh</strong> for selected high-potential projects</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"osso0e\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1491\"><strong data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1447\">Internship Opportunities</strong> for winners and top-performing participants</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yr48yh\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1522\"><strong data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1522\">Incubation Opportunities</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tjn7x9\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1594\"><strong data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1566\">Pre-Placement Interview Opportunities</strong> for eligible top performers</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"drzn15\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1628\"><strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1628\">Food, Goodies &amp; Merchandise</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16to53t\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1639\">Tracks</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1937\">\n<li data-section-id=\"ant4sp\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1664\"><strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1664\">Blockchain &amp; Web3</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"84kbhg\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1698\"><strong data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1698\">DeFi &amp; Financial Innovation</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"den87g\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1708\"><strong data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1708\">RWA</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rrh8wt\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1745\"><strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1745\">Consumer Blockchain &amp; Payments</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8zer01\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1775\"><strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1775\">AI &amp; Agentic Blockchain</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"whvv4f\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1811\"><strong data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1811\">Robotics &amp; Autonomous Systems</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14edr3e\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1829\"><strong data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1829\">DePIN &amp; IoT</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8i5l8h\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1859\"><strong data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1859\">Identity &amp; Verification</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"e05pol\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1892\"><strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1892\">Gaming &amp; Digital Economies</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9bozf\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1937\"><strong data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1937\">Enterprise, Government &amp; Social Impact</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2027\">Tracks are open-ended. <strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2027\">Combine multiple technologies and build something innovative.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2198\">Projects with <strong data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2084\">meaningful MST Blockchain integration</strong> may receive higher consideration. Simply adding blockchain without a clear purpose will not provide an advantage.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12uom9g\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2234\">24 Hours. Build Something Real.</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2277\"><strong data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2277\">IDEATE &rarr; BUILD &rarr; TEST &rarr; DEPLOY &rarr; DEMO</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2351\">Build a functional prototype and present it to the jury within 24 hours.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17dgb4q\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2364\">Judging</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2530\"><strong data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2530\">Innovation &bull; Problem-Solution Fit &bull; Technical Implementation &bull; Blockchain Utility &bull; Technology Integration &bull; Functionality &bull; Impact &bull; Scalability &bull; Presentation</strong></p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"186gzjm\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2555\">Who Can Participate?</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2720\">Students, freshers, working professionals, developers, designers, entrepreneurs, Web3 builders, AI/ML enthusiasts, robotics enthusiasts and technology enthusiasts.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2748\"><strong data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2748\">Team Size: 1&ndash;4 Members</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2811\">Individual, inter-college and cross-branch teams are welcome.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mz1otn\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2829\">Event Details</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"3041\"><strong data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2840\">Date:</strong> 28&ndash;29 September<br data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2859\" /><strong data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2869\">Venue:</strong> BMS College of Engineering, Bengaluru<br data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2910\" /><strong data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2921\">Format:</strong> Offline<br data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2932\" /><strong data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2945\">Duration:</strong> 24 Hours<br data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2957\" /><strong data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2975\">Maximum Teams:</strong> 100<br data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"2982\" /><strong data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3000\">Winning Teams:</strong> 25<br data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3006\" /><strong data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3027\">Registration Fee:</strong> ₹500 per team</p>\n<p data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3117\">Participants will receive <strong data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3116\">food, refreshments, goodies and merchandise</strong>.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tqw1u5\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3143\">Beyond the Buildathon</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3260\">Selected high-potential projects may be considered for <strong data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3259\">grants up to ₹50 Lakh, incubation and ecosystem support</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3395\">Eligible top-performing participants may also receive <strong data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3372\">internship and pre-placement interview opportunities</strong>, subject to selection.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3453\"><strong data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3453\">24 Hours. 100 Teams. 25 Winners. ₹2.5 Lakh+ Rewards.</strong></p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"a23mzo\" data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3483\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3483\" data-is-last-node=\"\">BUILD WHAT COMES NEXT.</strong></span></h2>",
